# Implementation Plan — Manager & Admin Panel Modules & Permissions

This implementation plan details the complete implementation and verification of the **Manager Panel (Operations Control Center)** and **Admin Panel (Business Command Center)** in LeadGrowth CRM.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Role Hierarchy & Access Controls**:
> 1. **User (Sales Executive)**: Restricted to personal assigned data (`WHERE assignedToId = userId`). No access to team analytics, user management, workspace settings, or financial profit/ROAS.
> 2. **Manager (Team Leader)**: Operations control over team members, lead queue auto/bulk assignment, task review & approvals, team follow-ups, and team analytics. Restricted from deleting/modifying Admins, Workspace Settings, API Keys, Billing, Audit Logs, System Monitoring, and Net Profit.
> 3. **Admin (Agency Owner)**: Complete control over the organization. Full CRUD on Users/Managers, workspace branding, billing, system health, security audit logs, API keys, and company-wide financial ROAS/ROI/Profit.

